// Backyard: the first arena. The beacon's yard is a cross in the middle: its centre and four
// arms. An arm has open ground on three sides, so a holder on it can be flanked and pushed out;
// the centre can be flanked only from the arms. The far lane is cut in two by a gate in a short
// wall; the lever on the near side swings it. A sprinkler sweeps the yard's four arms every
// fourth turn, and a garden tap on each side of the near edge sets it off early. Found things
// turn up in the far corners and beside the near lane.
id: backyard
name: Backyard
swing_ticks: 1
cooldown_turns: 1
event: soak
event_tiles: 4,2 3,3 5,3 4,4
event_first: 4
event_every: 4
switch_rest: 2
